    <string name="home_hint">Switching uses this TV\'s own ADB on port 5555.
1. Settings → System → About → press Build 7 times.
2. Developer options → USB debugging → on.
3. Port 5555 must be open: once from a computer, adb tcpip 5555 (again after a TV restart).
4. Press “Pair with this TV” and confirm “Allow debugging?” with “Always allow” ticked.</string>
